{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12133","headline":"登秦岭半岩遇雨 · 钱起","name":"登秦岭半岩遇雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"屏翳忽腾气，浮阳惨无晖。\n千峰挂飞雨，百尺摇翠微。\n震电闪云迳，奔流翻石矶。\n倚岩假松盖，临水羡荷衣。\n不得采苓去，空思乘月归。\n且怜东臯上，水色侵荆扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}